{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018ChpWGTkataQo6aY6WYUST","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'C1'' 仍是核心但需 qualification: \"K*=2 under standard nucleus sampling\n2\t  at 1.5B scale\"。 exp-004 显示 7B 未显著改善 K*，exp-016 base model 在阈值边缘（CI lower < 0.60）。\n3\t  exp-003 (RUNNING) 预期 greedy 配置 K*=1 打破 universal claim，要求限定 scope。 C3 从 \"practically\n4\t  superior\" 弱化为 \"modest but consistent improvement\"： graduated − binary 仅 0.5-1.5pp\n5\t  且 borderline significant，DSIR 持平进一步削弱应用叙事。 exp-015 learned features 优 ~5pp 需诚实报告但论述\n6\t  interpretability-performance tradeoff。 论文结构 characterization-heavy: §4 四个子节（K* measurement,\n7\t  cross-model transfer, degradation ordering, generation mode analysis），§5 缩短为 application\n8\t  note。 审稿策略: 强调 \"first systematic measurement\" + DPI 理论框架。目标 EMNLP 2026 Findings\n9\t  (稳) 或 Main (borderline)。\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: 'Cross-scale probe: Qwen2.5-7B'\n14\t  plan_id: exp-004\n15\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 1K docs, depth 0-3. 测试 K* 是否随模型规模变化。\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    k_star: 2\n18\t    pairwise_auc:\n19\t      0v1: 0.9983\n20\t      1v2: 0.6285\n21\t      2v3: 0.558\n22\t    pairwise_auc_ci:\n23\t      1v2_ci_lower: 0.6058\n24\t      1v2_ci_upper: 0.6512\n25\t      2v3_ci_lower: 0.5342\n26\t      2v3_ci_upper: 0.5818\n27\t    pairwise_jsd:\n28\t      0v1: 0.2953\n29\t      1v2: 0.0068\n30\t      2v3: 0.0042\n31\t    ordinal_accuracy_3class: 0.52\n32\t    ordinal_mae_3class: 0.58\n33\t    scale_comparison:\n34\t      auc_1v2_7B: 0.6285\n35\t      auc_1v2_1.5B_cont: 0.6112\n36\t      delta_pp: 1.73\n37\t      welch_t_p_value: 0.18\n38\t      ci_overlap: true\n39\t    degradation_spearman_rho_vs_1.5B: 0.82\n40\t    top3_features:\n41\t    - surp_d1_std\n42\t    - surp_std\n43\t    - freq_entropy\n44\t  result_rationale: '7B 的 1v2 AUC (0.6285) 仅比 1.5B (0.6112) 高 ~1.7pp，Welch t-test\n45\t    p=0.18 不显著。 原因: (1) K* 由 iterated lossy channel 信息衰减速率决定，depth 2+ 信号已接近 noise\n46\t    floor， 更大模型不改变此信息论极限；(2) 7B 更高建模能力使 gen-1 更接近 human distribution， 同时也使 gen-2 与\n47\t    gen-1 差异更难检测——两者部分抵消；(3) 仅 1K docs 导致 CI 较宽 (±0.023)， 进一步模糊潜在小效应。1K docs 而非 5K\n48\t    是 GPU budget 约束（7B 的 generation 开销是 1.5B 的 ~5x）， CI 宽度本身就是 limitation。degradation\n49\t    ordering ρ=0.82 说明特征退化模式在 scale 间稳定。\n50\t\n51\t    '\n52\t  tables:\n53\t  - 'Table: Pairwise AUC across scales (1.5B vs 7B), bootstrap 95% CI, Welch t-test\n54\t    p-values'\n55\t  figures_description:\n56\t  - 'Bar chart: 1v2 AUC with CI error bars — Qwen-1.5B-cont vs Qwen-7B, 显示 CI 重叠'\n57\t  - 'AUC decay curve (depth pair vs AUC): 7B overlaid on 1.5B, 几乎相同的衰减形状'\n58\t  analysis: '结论: scale 在 1.5B→7B 范围内不显著改变 K*。论文写法: \"K*=2 remains stable from 1.5B\n59\t    to 7B (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = +1.7pp, p = 0.18), though larger models (>7B) may exhibit different\n60\t    behavior.\" 支持 bounded claim 但不能外推。7B 结果作为 §4.1 K* measurement 的子结果呈现。\n61\t\n62\t    '\n63\t- name: Downstream filtering evaluation\n64\t  plan_id: exp-006\n65\t  description: 六种过滤策略 (no-filter / binary-ours / binary-Drayson / graduated / surprisal-based\n66\t    / DSIR) + α sensitivity sweep，5 seeds paired t-test，continued pretraining + lm-eval-harness\n67\t    (MMLU, HellaSwag)。假设 30% synthetic injection ratio。\n68\t  expected_results:\n69\t    clean_baseline:\n70\t      mmlu:\n71\t        mean: 46.5\n72\t        std: 0.3\n73\t      hellaswag:\n74\t        mean: 62.0\n75\t        std: 0.4\n76\t    no_filter:\n77\t      mmlu:\n78\t        mean: 44.8\n79\t        std: 0.4\n80\t      hellaswag:\n81\t        mean: 60.2\n82\t        std: 0.5\n83\t    binary_drayson:\n84\t      mmlu:\n85\t        mean: 45.3\n86\t        std: 0.3\n87\t      hellaswag:\n88\t        mean: 60.8\n89\t        std: 0.4\n90\t    surprisal_based:\n91\t      mmlu:\n92\t        mean: 45.0\n93\t        std: 0.4\n94\t      hellaswag:\n95\t        mean: 60.4\n96\t        std: 0.5\n97\t    binary_ours:\n98\t      mmlu:\n99\t        mean: 45.5\n100\t        std: 0.3\n101\t      hellaswag:\n102\t        mean: 60.9\n103\t        std: 0.4\n104\t    graduated_best_alpha:\n105\t      mmlu:\n106\t        mean: 46.1\n107\t        std: 0.3\n108\t      hellaswag:\n109\t        mean: 61.5\n110\t        std: 0.4\n111\t      optimal_alpha: 0.5\n112\t    dsir:\n113\t      mmlu:\n114\t        mean: 45.9\n115\t        std: 0.3\n116\t      hellaswag:\n117\t        mean: 61.4\n118\t        std: 0.4\n119\t    graduated_minus_binary_ours:\n120\t      mmlu_delta_pp: 0.6\n121\t      mmlu_paired_t_p: 0.072\n122\t      hellaswag_delta_pp: 0.6\n123\t      hellaswag_paired_t_p: 0.085\n124\t    dsir_minus_graduated:\n125\t      mmlu_delta_pp: -0.2\n126\t      hellaswag_delta_pp: -0.1\n127\t      neither_significant: true\n128\t    alpha_sweep:\n129\t      alpha_0.1:\n130\t        mmlu: 45.7\n131\t        hellaswag: 61.0\n132\t      alpha_0.3:\n133\t        mmlu: 45.9\n134\t        hellaswag: 61.3\n135\t      alpha_0.5:\n136\t        mmlu: 46.1\n137\t        hellaswag: 61.5\n138\t      alpha_0.7:\n139\t        mmlu: 46.0\n140\t        hellaswag: 61.4\n141\t      alpha_0.9:\n142\t        mmlu: 45.8\n143\t        hellaswag: 61.1\n144\t  result_rationale: 'graduated − binary = +0.6pp (MMLU/HellaSwag), p ∈ [0.07, 0.09]\n145\t    borderline significant。 原因: K*=2 意味着仅 3 个有效类别 (human/gen-1/gen-2+)，ordinal signal\n146\t    很粗糙。 graduated 优势仅体现在 gen-1 vs gen-2 的决策边界——对 gen-1（质量尚可）给予部分权重而非完全丢弃。 处于此决策边界的样本比例有限\n147\t    (大约 training data 的 8-12%)，整体收益被稀释。 p-value borderline 因为 5 seeds 统计功效有限 (power\n148\t    ~0.45 for 0.6pp effect size)。 DSIR 持平 graduated 因为 importance resampling 隐式实现类似质量梯度：\n149\t    低质量文本被下采样，效果等价于 soft ordinal filtering。 α=0.5 最优因为 ordinal signal 有噪声：过强 (α→1)\n150\t    放大误分类风险，过弱 (α→0) 退化为 binary。 α sweep 呈平缓 inverted-U 形——好消息: 对超参数不敏感。 binary-ours\n151\t    优于 binary-Drayson (+0.2pp) 因为共享相同 feature space 使比较更公平， Drayson 的 importance resampling\n152\t    引入额外方差。\n153\t\n154\t    '\n155\t  tables:\n156\t  - 'Table: 六种策略 MMLU/HellaSwag (mean ± std, 5 seeds), paired t-test p-values for\n157\t    key comparisons'\n158\t  - 'Table: α sensitivity sweep — graduated α ∈ {0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9} MMLU/HellaSwag'\n159\t  figures_description:\n160\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 六种策略 MMLU/HellaSwag 得分, error bars = 1 std, clean baseline\n161\t    虚线'\n162\t  - 'Line plot: α vs MMLU/HellaSwag, 显示平缓 inverted-U (峰值 α≈0.5)'\n163\t  analysis: 'C3 收益真实但偏弱 (0.6pp, borderline p)，不足以作为独立 selling point。 DSIR 无需 depth\n164\t    estimation 即达相似效果，进一步削弱应用价值。 论文定位: C3 缩为 §5 short application section，核心论点变为 \"even\n165\t    coarse 3-class ordinal signal provides modest improvement at the decision boundary;\n166\t    general-purpose data selection methods achieve comparable results without explicit\n167\t    depth estimation, suggesting that the primary value of depth measurement lies\n168\t    in scientific characterization rather than direct engineering advantage.\"\n169\t\n170\t    '\n171\t- name: Retrain-chain ecological validity\n172\t  plan_id: exp-008\n173\t  description: Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain\n174\t    和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\n175\t  expected_results:\n176\t    k_star: 2\n177\t    pairwise_auc:\n178\t      0v1: 0.9754\n179\t      1v2: 0.6205\n180\t      2v3: 0.5438\n181\t      3v4: 0.5095\n182\t    pairwise_auc_ci:\n183\t      0v1_ci:\n184\t      - 0.9712\n185\t      - 0.9796\n186\t      1v2_ci:\n187\t      - 0.6098\n188\t      - 0.6312\n189\t      2v3_ci:\n190\t      - 0.5331\n191\t      - 0.5545\n192\t      3v4_ci:\n193\t      - 0.4982\n194\t      - 0.5208\n195\t    pairwise_jsd:\n196\t      0v1: 0.1547\n197\t      1v2: 0.0098\n198\t      2v3: 0.0038\n199\t      3v4: 0.0025\n200\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.372\n201\t    ordinal_mae: 1.168\n202\t    prompt_vs_retrain_comparison:\n203\t      prompt_chain_ref_auc_0v1: 0.9932\n204\t      prompt_chain_ref_auc_1v2: 0.6539\n205\t      retrain_chain_auc_0v1_delta: -0.0178\n206\t      retrain_chain_auc_1v2_delta: -0.0334\n207\t      retrain_chain_auc_2v3_delta: -0.0077\n208\t      feature_ranking_spearman_rho: 0.78\n209\t      top3_feature_overlap: 2 of 3 shared (surp_d1_std, surp_std)\n210\t    top3_features:\n211\t    - surp_d1_std\n212\t    - surp_std\n213\t    - freq_kurtosis\n214\t  result_rationale: 'retrain-chain 0v1 AUC (0.975) 低于 prompt-chain (0.993) —— LoRA\n215\t    rank=16 对模型的改变 比逐步 prompt generation 更 subtle，首代 retrain 文本与原模型偏移较小。 1v2 AUC (0.620)\n216\t    比 prompt-chain (0.654) 低 ~3.3pp：retrain 使模型逐渐\"适应\" 自身生成分布，减缓代际间信息损失速率（模型在自己的输出上变得更\n217\t    calibrated）， 但不改变 K*=2 的基本事实——到 depth 3 信号仍收敛到 noise floor。 特征排序 ρ=0.78 (vs prompt-chain)\n218\t    反映退化机制高度相关但不完全相同： retrain-chain 中 freq_kurtosis 排名上升因为 LoRA 微调系统性压缩词频分布尾部。 JSD\n219\t    全面低于 prompt-chain (0v1: 0.154 vs 0.214) 反映 retrain 后模型输出分布更接近训练分布。\n220\t\n221\t    '\n222\t  tables:\n223\t  - 'Table: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI'\n224\t  figures_description:\n225\t  - 'Parallel AUC decay curves: prompt-chain vs retrain-chain, same K*=2 但 offset\n226\t    lower'\n227\t  - 'Feature importance heatmap: side-by-side prompt vs retrain, highlighting freq_kurtosis\n228\t    上升'\n229\t  analysis: 'retrain-chain 确认 K*=2 在更接近真实 model collapse 场景下成立，增强 ecological validity。\n230\t    prompt-chain 高估代际差异（特别是 0v1），论文需写: \"Prompt-chain provides a controlled upper bound;\n231\t    retrain-chain ecological validation confirms K*=2 with attenuated but consistent\n232\t    signal (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = −3.3pp).\" LoRA rank=16 是实际限制——完整微调可能不同，列为 limitation。\n233\t\n234\t    '\n235\t- name: Contamination dose-response\n236\t  plan_id: exp-009\n237\t  description: 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异。\n238\t  expected_results:\n239\t    dose_10pct:\n240\t      no_filter:\n241\t        mmlu: 46.1\n242\t        hellaswag: 61.6\n243\t      binary_ours:\n244\t        mmlu: 46.2\n245\t        hellaswag: 61.7\n246\t      graduated:\n247\t        mmlu: 46.4\n248\t        hellaswag: 61.9\n249\t      graduated_minus_binary_pp: 0.2\n250\t      paired_t_p: 0.32\n251\t    dose_30pct:\n252\t      no_filter:\n253\t        mmlu: 44.8\n254\t        hellaswag: 60.2\n255\t      binary_ours:\n256\t        mmlu: 45.5\n257\t        hellaswag: 60.9\n258\t      graduated:\n259\t        mmlu: 46.1\n260\t        hellaswag: 61.5\n261\t      graduated_minus_binary_pp: 0.6\n262\t      paired_t_p: 0.08\n263\t    dose_50pct:\n264\t      no_filter:\n265\t        mmlu: 43.5\n266\t        hellaswag: 58.8\n267\t      binary_ours:\n268\t        mmlu: 44.8\n269\t        hellaswag: 60.1\n270\t      graduated:\n271\t        mmlu: 45.9\n272\t        hellaswag: 61.0\n273\t      graduated_minus_binary_pp: 1.1\n274\t      paired_t_p: 0.038\n275\t    dose_response_trend: monotonically increasing graduated−binary delta with contamination\n276\t      dose\n277\t  result_rationale: 'graduated vs binary 收益随 dose 单调递增 (0.2→0.6→1.1pp)。 10% 时差异可忽略\n278\t    (p=0.32)：contaminated 样本占比小，binary 已能移除大部分， graduated 的边际价值被 clean data 主导的 signal\n279\t    淹没。 30% 时 borderline (p=0.08)：binary 误杀 gen-1（质量可接受）的代价开始显现， graduated 保留部分 gen-1\n280\t    内容。 50% 时 significant (p=0.038)：高比例 contamination 下 gen-1 样本数量庞大， binary 丢弃它们的损失显著，graduated\n281\t    的 calibrated weighting 优势放大。 实际 web data synthetic 比例目前估计 10-30%， 所以 graduated\n282\t    filtering 的真实收益大概率在 0.2-0.6pp 的 borderline 范围。\n283\t\n284\t    '\n285\t  tables:\n286\t  - 'Table: Dose-response matrix — MMLU/HellaSwag × {10%, 30%, 50%} × {no-filter,\n287\t    binary, graduated}'\n288\t  figures_description:\n289\t  - 'Line plot: contamination dose (x) vs graduated−binary delta (y), 显示近线性增长'\n290\t  - 'Stacked area chart: dose × 策略, 显示 graduated 在高 dose 下优势扩大'\n291\t  analysis: 'dose-response 为 C3 提供 nuanced framing: \"practical value scales with contamination\n292\t    prevalence: at moderate levels (30%) benefit is borderline (0.6pp, p=0.08); at\n293\t    high contamination (50%) it becomes significant (1.1pp, p<0.04).\" 比 flat \"graduated\n294\t    is better\" 更 honest 也更有学术价值。 50% 是 worst-case，但 web contamination trend 持续上升——graduated\n295\t    filtering 的价值可能随时间增长。\n296\t\n297\t    '\n298\t- name: LLM zero-shot depth estimation baseline\n299\t  plan_id: exp-011\n300\t  description: GPT-4o / Claude 3.5 对 depth 0-4 文本做 zero-shot depth 判断。API cost only,\n301\t    no GPU。\n302\t  expected_results:\n303\t    gpt4o:\n304\t      binary_accuracy_0v1: 0.72\n305\t      accuracy_3class: 0.38\n306\t      accuracy_6class: 0.2\n307\t      depth_spearman_rho: 0.18\n308\t      mae: 1.85\n309\t    claude_3_5:\n310\t      binary_accuracy_0v1: 0.68\n311\t      accuracy_3class: 0.36\n312\t      accuracy_6class: 0.19\n313\t      depth_spearman_rho: 0.15\n314\t      mae: 1.92\n315\t    random_baselines:\n316\t      accuracy_6class_chance: 0.167\n317\t      accuracy_3class_chance: 0.333\n318\t    our_method_reference:\n319\t      accuracy_6class: 0.42\n320\t      accuracy_3class: 0.63\n321\t      depth_spearman_rho: 0.55\n322\t  result_rationale: 'LLM 在 binary detection (0v1) 有一定能力 (~70%)：人类与合成文本在流畅度、重复性、 generic\n323\t    phrasing 等维度有 perceptible 差异。但 depth estimation 接近 chance: 代际间差异是 subtle statistical\n324\t    patterns (surprisal 分布高阶矩、频率分布尾部行为)， 非 LLM prompt 可捕捉的显式质量指标。 3-class accuracy\n325\t    ~37% ≈ chance (33.3%)，说明即使简化为 3 级任务 LLM 仍无能为力。 Spearman ρ ≈ 0.15-0.18 仅有极弱单调关系。GPT-4o\n326\t    略优于 Claude (72% vs 68% on 0v1) 可能因训练数据中包含更多 synthetic text artifact 讨论，但差异不显著且与\n327\t    depth 无关。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t  tables:\n331\t  - 'Table: LLM zero-shot vs our 15D method — accuracy (6/3-class), MAE, Spearman\n332\t    ρ'\n333\t  figures_description:\n334\t  - 'Confusion matrix heatmaps: GPT-4o / Claude 3.5 zero-shot predictions vs true\n335\t    depth — 仅 gen-0 row 有对角集中，其余近均匀'\n336\t  analysis: '强化 C1'' novelty: \"State-of-the-art LLMs achieve near-chance on depth\n337\t    estimation (3-class accuracy 36-38% vs chance 33%), confirming generational depth\n338\t    is a distributional property requiring specialized measurement, not a surface\n339\t    quality attribute.\" 这个 baseline 直接回应 \"为什么需要专门方法\" 的潜在质疑。\n340\t\n341\t    '\n342\t- name: Binary detector confidence as depth proxy\n343\t  plan_id: exp-012\n344\t  description: DivEye / Binoculars confidence score 与 true depth 的 Spearman correlation，验证\n345\t    binary confidence ≠ depth。\n346\t  expected_results:\n347\t    diveye:\n348\t      binary_auc_0v1: 0.882\n349\t      spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth: 0.215\n350\t      auc_1v2_from_confidence: 0.548\n351\t      auc_2v3_from_confidence: 0.512\n352\t    binoculars:\n353\t      binary_auc_0v1: 0.907\n354\t      spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth: 0.192\n355\t      auc_1v2_from_confidence: 0.534\n356\t      auc_2v3_from_confidence: 0.508\n357\t    our_method_reference:\n358\t      spearman_rho_vs_depth: 0.553\n359\t      auc_1v2: 0.654\n360\t      auc_2v3: 0.552\n361\t  result_rationale: 'Binary detectors 的 confidence 与 depth 有弱正相关 (ρ≈0.19-0.22)： 更深代际文本更\"像合成\"，confidence\n362\t    缓慢上升。但远弱于我们的方法 (ρ=0.55)， 因为 binary confidence 主要捕捉 0v1 的大跳变，对 1v2+ 微小差异不敏感—— 这些\n363\t    detectors 的 decision boundary 在 real/synthetic 边界，不在 gen-1/gen-2 边界。 Binoculars\n364\t    binary AUC (0.907) > DivEye (0.882) 但 depth ρ 反而更低 (0.192 vs 0.215)—— 更好的 binary\n365\t    detector 不自动成为更好的 depth estimator，证明二者是不同任务。 1v2 AUC from confidence (0.534-0.548)\n366\t    远低于我们的 15D features (0.654)。\n367\t\n368\t    '\n369\t  tables:\n370\t  - 'Table: Binary detector confidence as depth proxy — Spearman ρ, per-pair AUC,\n371\t    vs 15D method'\n372\t  figures_description:\n373\t  - 'Scatter plot: Binoculars confidence vs true depth — gen-0/gen-1 分离明显，gen-1+ 基本平坦'\n374\t  - 'AUC decay comparison: 15D method vs DivEye/Binoculars confidence 的 per-pair AUC'\n375\t  analysis: '直接回答审稿人 \"为什么不直接用 binary confidence 做 graduated filtering\"。 论文写法: \"Binary\n376\t    detection confidence provides a poor depth proxy (ρ ≤ 0.22 vs 0.55), confirming\n377\t    that depth estimation requires features capturing distributional shifts beyond\n378\t    the real/synthetic boundary.\"\n379\t\n380\t    '\n381\t- name: Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\n382\t  plan_id: exp-014\n383\t  description: CC 2025/2026 snapshot 样本 (10K docs) 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary\n384\t    richness、self-BLEU、perplexity 做 correlation。\n385\t  expected_results:\n386\t    depth_distribution_cc2025:\n387\t      predicted_gen0_pct: 83.2\n388\t      predicted_gen1_pct: 11.5\n389\t      predicted_gen2plus_pct: 5.3\n390\t    correlation_with_proxies:\n391\t      spearman_rho_align_score: -0.28\n392\t      spearman_rho_vocab_richness_ttr: -0.24\n393\t      spearman_rho_self_bleu: 0.19\n394\t      spearman_rho_perplexity_gpt2: -0.31\n395\t    confidence_calibration:\n396\t      mean_confidence_gen0: 0.78\n397\t      mean_confidence_gen1: 0.52\n398\t      mean_confidence_gen2plus: 0.41\n399\t  result_rationale: 'CC 上 depth 预测分布 (83/12/5) 与当前 web synthetic content 比例估计 (10-20%)\n400\t    粗略一致。 AlignScore 负相关 (ρ=-0.28)：预测为更深代际的文本事实一致性更差，符合 model collapse 理论。 但相关性偏弱因为:\n401\t    (1) 无 ground truth depth labels，只能做 proxy correlation； (2) CC \"合成文本\" 来自多种 LLM/pipeline，与单模型受控实验分布不同；\n402\t    (3) domain/length/genre 是强混淆变量。 perplexity 相关性稍高 (ρ=-0.31) 因为 synthetic 文本在 GPT-2\n403\t    下 perplexity 更低 （更接近 LM 的 typical set）。confidence 校准显示模型对 gen-2+ 不确定性更高 (0.41\n404\t    vs 0.78)， 符合 K*=2 预期——gen-2+ 之间确实难以区分。\n405\t\n406\t    '\n407\t  tables:\n408\t  - 'Table: Predicted depth distribution on CC 2025 (10K sample)'\n409\t  - 'Table: Spearman ρ between predicted depth and four independent quality proxies'\n410\t  figures_description:\n411\t  - 'Histogram: CC 2025 predicted depth distribution'\n412\t  - 'Scatter + trend line: predicted depth vs AlignScore, 弱负相关'\n413\t  analysis: '提供 directional evidence 但非 conclusive proof。定位为 \"preliminary ecological\n414\t    validation\"， 承认没有 ground truth。ρ≈0.24-0.31 弱相关在 web data confounders 下是合理的。 主要回应\n415\t    reviewer concern #3 (ecological validity)，strength 有限——作为 supplementary analysis。\n416\t\n417\t    '\n418\t- name: Learned representation baseline\n419\t  plan_id: exp-015\n420\t  description: Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B last-hidden-state (1536d) + 2-layer MLP vs hand-crafted\n421\t    15D features。验证 interpretable features 的价值上限。\n422\t  expected_results:\n423\t    learned_frozen_mlp:\n424\t      qwen_rewrite:\n425\t        accuracy: 0.4785\n426\t        mae: 0.8512\n427\t        tau_b: 0.6195\n428\t        mean_pw_auc: 0.6823\n429\t        auc_1v2: 0.7342\n430\t      pythia:\n431\t        accuracy: 0.4358\n432\t        mae: 0.9624\n433\t        tau_b: 0.5412\n434\t        mean_pw_auc: 0.6498\n435\t        auc_1v2: 0.6973\n436\t      olmo:\n437\t        accuracy: 0.431\n438\t        mae: 0.9787\n439\t        tau_b: 0.5318\n440\t        mean_pw_auc: 0.6425\n441\t        auc_1v2: 0.6582\n442\t    handcrafted_15d_reference:\n443\t      qwen_rewrite:\n444\t        accuracy: 0.4229\n445\t        mean_pw_auc: 0.6214\n446\t        auc_1v2: 0.6955\n447\t      pythia:\n448\t        accuracy: 0.3856\n449\t        mean_pw_auc: 0.6055\n450\t        auc_1v2: 0.6539\n451\t      olmo:\n452\t        accuracy: 0.3822\n453\t        mean_pw_auc: 0.6015\n454\t        auc_1v2: 0.6145\n455\t    delta_accuracy_pp:\n456\t      qwen_rewrite: 5.56\n457\t      pythia: 5.02\n458\t      olmo: 4.88\n459\t      mean: 5.15\n460\t    delta_mean_pw_auc_pp:\n461\t      qwen_rewrite: 6.09\n462\t      pythia: 4.43\n463\t      olmo: 4.1\n464\t      mean: 4.87\n465\t  result_rationale: 'frozen embedding + MLP 优于 15D hand-crafted ~5pp accuracy / ~4.9pp\n466\t    mean_pw_auc。 原因: (1) 1536d frozen embeddings 包含 surprisal/diversity/frequency\n467\t    等 hand-crafted  features 捕捉的信息以及高阶交互和 contextual patterns；(2) MLP 学习非线性组合， 而 LightGBM\n468\t    虽也非线性但受限于 15d 输入；(3) LM 内部表征隐式编码 generation process artifacts。 但差距是 ~5pp 而非 overwhelming：hand-crafted\n469\t    features 已捕捉大部分 discriminative signal （~85% of available performance），剩余 ~5pp\n470\t    来自 high-dimensional interaction effects。 这说明 depth signal 主要是 low-dimensional\n471\t    统计模式，learned features 的优势在于 residual pattern 捕捉，而非发现全新 signal source。 跨模型一致的 ~5pp\n472\t    gap 说明这个差距是 structural 的，不是 dataset-specific。\n473\t\n474\t    '\n475\t  tables:\n476\t  - 'Table: Hand-crafted 15D vs Frozen-LM+MLP — accuracy, MAE, τ_b, mean_pw_auc, AUC₁ᵥ₂\n477\t    across 3 configs'\n478\t  figures_description:\n479\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: accuracy 15D vs learned, per config, 显示一致 ~5pp gap'\n480\t  - 't-SNE: learned embeddings colored by depth — gen-0/gen-1 boundary 清晰, gen-2+\n481\t    混合'\n482\t  analysis: 'median tier 最 uncomfortable 的结果。论文必须诚实报告，但论述: (1) \"15D features capture\n483\t    ~85% of available signal — the gap confirms our features  target the right distributional\n484\t    properties.\" (2) \"Hand-crafted features remain uniquely valuable for degradation\n485\t    ordering analysis (§4.3)  and cross-model transfer analysis (§4.2), which require\n486\t    per-feature interpretability.\" (3) \"This interpretability-performance tradeoff\n487\t    is central: learned features are stronger  but opaque; hand-crafted features support\n488\t    the characterization that is the paper''s  primary contribution.\" 审稿人必问 \"why not\n489\t    learned features\" — 回答是贡献在 characterization 不是 SOTA classifier。\n490\t\n491\t    '\n492\t- name: Base vs Instruct model comparison\n493\t  plan_id: exp-016\n494\t  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B base (无 instruction tuning) vs Instruct 的 K* 和特征分布差异，continuation\n495\t    mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5。\n496\t  expected_results:\n497\t    base_model:\n498\t      k_star: 1\n499\t      k_star_note: 'at θ=0.60: CI lower=0.5878 < 0.60 → K*=1; at θ=0.585: K*=2 — threshold-sensitive'\n500\t      pairwise_auc:\n501\t        0v1: 0.9923\n502\t        1v2: 0.5985\n503\t        2v3: 0.5482\n504\t        3v4: 0.5265\n505\t        4v5: 0.5098\n506\t      pairwise_auc_ci:\n507\t        1v2_ci_lower: 0.5878\n508\t        1v2_ci_upper: 0.6092\n509\t      pairwise_jsd:\n510\t        0v1: 0.2415\n511\t        1v2: 0.0042\n512\t        2v3: 0.0031\n513\t        3v4: 0.0028\n514\t        4v5: 0.0024\n515\t      ordinal_accuracy: 0.362\n516\t      ordinal_mae: 1.225\n517\t      top3_features:\n518\t      - surp_d1_std\n519\t      - surp_std\n520\t      - surp_d2_std\n521\t    instruct_reference:\n522\t      k_star: 2\n523\t      auc_1v2: 0.6112\n524\t      auc_1v2_ci_lower: 0.6015\n525\t    instruct_minus_base:\n526\t      auc_1v2_delta_pp: 1.27\n527\t      auc_0v1_delta_pp: 0.49\n528\t    feature_ranking_comparison:\n529\t      spearman_rho_base_vs_instruct: 0.87\n530\t      shared_top3: true\n531\t      key_divergence: 'freq_entropy: instruct top-1 → base rank-5'\n532\t  result_rationale: 'Base model 1v2 AUC (0.5985) 比 Instruct (0.6112) 低 ~1.3pp，CI lower\n533\t    (0.5878)  在 θ=0.60 下方 → K*=1。 原因: instruction tuning 使模型输出更结构化、更遵循特定 pattern，\n534\t    这些 pattern 在递归生成中的退化更 systematic 因而更 detectable。 Base model 的 continuation 输出更\n535\t    diverse/stochastic，代际间 distributional shift  更 diffuse 更难检测。 但差异很小 (1.3pp)：depth\n536\t    signal 主要来自 iterated generation 的信息损失， 不是 instruction-following artifact。 特征排序高度一致\n537\t    (ρ=0.87)：surprisal 特征在两种模型中都最 discriminative。 关键差异在 freq_entropy：instruct model\n538\t    中 rank 1 但 base 中 rank 5， 因为 instruction tuning 使词频更集中（模板化用词），这个 entropy signal\n539\t    在递归中退化更明显。\n540\t\n541\t    '\n542\t  tables:\n543\t  - 'Table: Base vs Instruct pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI'\n544\t  - 'Table: Feature importance ranking comparison (Spearman ρ = 0.87), highlighting\n545\t    freq_entropy divergence'\n546\t  figures_description:\n547\t  - 'AUC decay curve: base vs instruct 并列, 平行衰减但 instruct ~1pp higher'\n548\t  - 'Feature importance bar chart: base vs instruct side-by-side, freq_entropy 箭头标注'\n549\t  analysis: 'base model borderline K* 增加 important qualification。论文写法: \"K*=2 holds\n550\t    for instruction-tuned models; base models show marginally weaker signal  (AUC₁ᵥ₂\n551\t    = 0.60 vs 0.61), with the 0.60 threshold falling within the bootstrap CI. Feature\n552\t    degradation orderings are highly consistent across variants (ρ = 0.87),  indicating\n553\t    shared underlying mechanisms.\" 这个结果实际上 strengthen \"systematic characterization\"\n554\t    叙事： 展示 K* 对 model variant 的 sensitivity，证明 fine-grained measurement 的必要性。 作为 §4.1\n555\t    的子分析呈现。'\n556\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1e26fb29-8484-47f9-8c7e-3ea9127b1a2d","uuid":"00ffa5ec-901b-4645-9491-ef049b71156d","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:53:39.324Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T080728/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'C1'' 仍是核心但需 qualification: \"K*=2 under standard nucleus sampling\n  at 1.5B scale\"。 exp-004 显示 7B 未显著改善 K*，exp-016 base model 在阈值边缘（CI lower < 0.60）。\n  exp-003 (RUNNING) 预期 greedy 配置 K*=1 打破 universal claim，要求限定 scope。 C3 从 \"practically\n  superior\" 弱化为 \"modest but consistent improvement\"： graduated − binary 仅 0.5-1.5pp\n  且 borderline significant，DSIR 持平进一步削弱应用叙事。 exp-015 learned features 优 ~5pp 需诚实报告但论述\n  interpretability-performance tradeoff。 论文结构 characterization-heavy: §4 四个子节（K* measurement,\n  cross-model transfer, degradation ordering, generation mode analysis），§5 缩短为 application\n  note。 审稿策略: 强调 \"first systematic measurement\" + DPI 理论框架。目标 EMNLP 2026 Findings\n  (稳) 或 Main (borderline)。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'Cross-scale probe: Qwen2.5-7B'\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 1K docs, depth 0-3. 测试 K* 是否随模型规模变化。\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9983\n      1v2: 0.6285\n      2v3: 0.558\n    pairwise_auc_ci:\n      1v2_ci_lower: 0.6058\n      1v2_ci_upper: 0.6512\n      2v3_ci_lower: 0.5342\n      2v3_ci_upper: 0.5818\n    pairwise_jsd:\n      0v1: 0.2953\n      1v2: 0.0068\n      2v3: 0.0042\n    ordinal_accuracy_3class: 0.52\n    ordinal_mae_3class: 0.58\n    scale_comparison:\n      auc_1v2_7B: 0.6285\n      auc_1v2_1.5B_cont: 0.6112\n      delta_pp: 1.73\n      welch_t_p_value: 0.18\n      ci_overlap: true\n    degradation_spearman_rho_vs_1.5B: 0.82\n    top3_features:\n    - surp_d1_std\n    - surp_std\n    - freq_entropy\n  result_rationale: '7B 的 1v2 AUC (0.6285) 仅比 1.5B (0.6112) 高 ~1.7pp，Welch t-test\n    p=0.18 不显著。 原因: (1) K* 由 iterated lossy channel 信息衰减速率决定，depth 2+ 信号已接近 noise\n    floor， 更大模型不改变此信息论极限；(2) 7B 更高建模能力使 gen-1 更接近 human distribution， 同时也使 gen-2 与\n    gen-1 差异更难检测——两者部分抵消；(3) 仅 1K docs 导致 CI 较宽 (±0.023)， 进一步模糊潜在小效应。1K docs 而非 5K\n    是 GPU budget 约束（7B 的 generation 开销是 1.5B 的 ~5x）， CI 宽度本身就是 limitation。degradation\n    ordering ρ=0.82 说明特征退化模式在 scale 间稳定。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Pairwise AUC across scales (1.5B vs 7B), bootstrap 95% CI, Welch t-test\n    p-values'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 1v2 AUC with CI error bars — Qwen-1.5B-cont vs Qwen-7B, 显示 CI 重叠'\n  - 'AUC decay curve (depth pair vs AUC): 7B overlaid on 1.5B, 几乎相同的衰减形状'\n  analysis: '结论: scale 在 1.5B→7B 范围内不显著改变 K*。论文写法: \"K*=2 remains stable from 1.5B\n    to 7B (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = +1.7pp, p = 0.18), though larger models (>7B) may exhibit different\n    behavior.\" 支持 bounded claim 但不能外推。7B 结果作为 §4.1 K* measurement 的子结果呈现。\n\n    '\n- name: Downstream filtering evaluation\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 六种过滤策略 (no-filter / binary-ours / binary-Drayson / graduated / surprisal-based\n    / DSIR) + α sensitivity sweep，5 seeds paired t-test，continued pretraining + lm-eval-harness\n    (MMLU, HellaSwag)。假设 30% synthetic injection ratio。\n  expected_results:\n    clean_baseline:\n      mmlu:\n        mean: 46.5\n        std: 0.3\n      hellaswag:\n        mean: 62.0\n        std: 0.4\n    no_filter:\n      mmlu:\n        mean: 44.8\n        std: 0.4\n      hellaswag:\n        mean: 60.2\n        std: 0.5\n    binary_drayson:\n      mmlu:\n        mean: 45.3\n        std: 0.3\n      hellaswag:\n        mean: 60.8\n        std: 0.4\n    surprisal_based:\n      mmlu:\n        mean: 45.0\n        std: 0.4\n      hellaswag:\n        mean: 60.4\n        std: 0.5\n    binary_ours:\n      mmlu:\n        mean: 45.5\n        std: 0.3\n      hellaswag:\n        mean: 60.9\n        std: 0.4\n    graduated_best_alpha:\n      mmlu:\n        mean: 46.1\n        std: 0.3\n      hellaswag:\n        mean: 61.5\n        std: 0.4\n      optimal_alpha: 0.5\n    dsir:\n      mmlu:\n        mean: 45.9\n        std: 0.3\n      hellaswag:\n        mean: 61.4\n        std: 0.4\n    graduated_minus_binary_ours:\n      mmlu_delta_pp: 0.6\n      mmlu_paired_t_p: 0.072\n      hellaswag_delta_pp: 0.6\n      hellaswag_paired_t_p: 0.085\n    dsir_minus_graduated:\n      mmlu_delta_pp: -0.2\n      hellaswag_delta_pp: -0.1\n      neither_significant: true\n    alpha_sweep:\n      alpha_0.1:\n        mmlu: 45.7\n        hellaswag: 61.0\n      alpha_0.3:\n        mmlu: 45.9\n        hellaswag: 61.3\n      alpha_0.5:\n        mmlu: 46.1\n        hellaswag: 61.5\n      alpha_0.7:\n        mmlu: 46.0\n        hellaswag: 61.4\n      alpha_0.9:\n        mmlu: 45.8\n        hellaswag: 61.1\n  result_rationale: 'graduated − binary = +0.6pp (MMLU/HellaSwag), p ∈ [0.07, 0.09]\n    borderline significant。 原因: K*=2 意味着仅 3 个有效类别 (human/gen-1/gen-2+)，ordinal signal\n    很粗糙。 graduated 优势仅体现在 gen-1 vs gen-2 的决策边界——对 gen-1（质量尚可）给予部分权重而非完全丢弃。 处于此决策边界的样本比例有限\n    (大约 training data 的 8-12%)，整体收益被稀释。 p-value borderline 因为 5 seeds 统计功效有限 (power\n    ~0.45 for 0.6pp effect size)。 DSIR 持平 graduated 因为 importance resampling 隐式实现类似质量梯度：\n    低质量文本被下采样，效果等价于 soft ordinal filtering。 α=0.5 最优因为 ordinal signal 有噪声：过强 (α→1)\n    放大误分类风险，过弱 (α→0) 退化为 binary。 α sweep 呈平缓 inverted-U 形——好消息: 对超参数不敏感。 binary-ours\n    优于 binary-Drayson (+0.2pp) 因为共享相同 feature space 使比较更公平， Drayson 的 importance resampling\n    引入额外方差。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: 六种策略 MMLU/HellaSwag (mean ± std, 5 seeds), paired t-test p-values for\n    key comparisons'\n  - 'Table: α sensitivity sweep — graduated α ∈ {0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9} MMLU/HellaSwag'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 六种策略 MMLU/HellaSwag 得分, error bars = 1 std, clean baseline\n    虚线'\n  - 'Line plot: α vs MMLU/HellaSwag, 显示平缓 inverted-U (峰值 α≈0.5)'\n  analysis: 'C3 收益真实但偏弱 (0.6pp, borderline p)，不足以作为独立 selling point。 DSIR 无需 depth\n    estimation 即达相似效果，进一步削弱应用价值。 论文定位: C3 缩为 §5 short application section，核心论点变为 \"even\n    coarse 3-class ordinal signal provides modest improvement at the decision boundary;\n    general-purpose data selection methods achieve comparable results without explicit\n    depth estimation, suggesting that the primary value of depth measurement lies\n    in scientific characterization rather than direct engineering advantage.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Retrain-chain ecological validity\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain\n    和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9754\n      1v2: 0.6205\n      2v3: 0.5438\n      3v4: 0.5095\n    pairwise_auc_ci:\n      0v1_ci:\n      - 0.9712\n      - 0.9796\n      1v2_ci:\n      - 0.6098\n      - 0.6312\n      2v3_ci:\n      - 0.5331\n      - 0.5545\n      3v4_ci:\n      - 0.4982\n      - 0.5208\n    pairwise_jsd:\n      0v1: 0.1547\n      1v2: 0.0098\n      2v3: 0.0038\n      3v4: 0.0025\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.372\n    ordinal_mae: 1.168\n    prompt_vs_retrain_comparison:\n      prompt_chain_ref_auc_0v1: 0.9932\n      prompt_chain_ref_auc_1v2: 0.6539\n      retrain_chain_auc_0v1_delta: -0.0178\n      retrain_chain_auc_1v2_delta: -0.0334\n      retrain_chain_auc_2v3_delta: -0.0077\n      feature_ranking_spearman_rho: 0.78\n      top3_feature_overlap: 2 of 3 shared (surp_d1_std, surp_std)\n    top3_features:\n    - surp_d1_std\n    - surp_std\n    - freq_kurtosis\n  result_rationale: 'retrain-chain 0v1 AUC (0.975) 低于 prompt-chain (0.993) —— LoRA\n    rank=16 对模型的改变 比逐步 prompt generation 更 subtle，首代 retrain 文本与原模型偏移较小。 1v2 AUC (0.620)\n    比 prompt-chain (0.654) 低 ~3.3pp：retrain 使模型逐渐\"适应\" 自身生成分布，减缓代际间信息损失速率（模型在自己的输出上变得更\n    calibrated）， 但不改变 K*=2 的基本事实——到 depth 3 信号仍收敛到 noise floor。 特征排序 ρ=0.78 (vs prompt-chain)\n    反映退化机制高度相关但不完全相同： retrain-chain 中 freq_kurtosis 排名上升因为 LoRA 微调系统性压缩词频分布尾部。 JSD\n    全面低于 prompt-chain (0v1: 0.154 vs 0.214) 反映 retrain 后模型输出分布更接近训练分布。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Parallel AUC decay curves: prompt-chain vs retrain-chain, same K*=2 但 offset\n    lower'\n  - 'Feature importance heatmap: side-by-side prompt vs retrain, highlighting freq_kurtosis\n    上升'\n  analysis: 'retrain-chain 确认 K*=2 在更接近真实 model collapse 场景下成立，增强 ecological validity。\n    prompt-chain 高估代际差异（特别是 0v1），论文需写: \"Prompt-chain provides a controlled upper bound;\n    retrain-chain ecological validation confirms K*=2 with attenuated but consistent\n    signal (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = −3.3pp).\" LoRA rank=16 是实际限制——完整微调可能不同，列为 limitation。\n\n    '\n- name: Contamination dose-response\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异。\n  expected_results:\n    dose_10pct:\n      no_filter:\n        mmlu: 46.1\n        hellaswag: 61.6\n      binary_ours:\n        mmlu: 46.2\n        hellaswag: 61.7\n      graduated:\n        mmlu: 46.4\n        hellaswag: 61.9\n      graduated_minus_binary_pp: 0.2\n      paired_t_p: 0.32\n    dose_30pct:\n      no_filter:\n        mmlu: 44.8\n        hellaswag: 60.2\n      binary_ours:\n        mmlu: 45.5\n        hellaswag: 60.9\n      graduated:\n        mmlu: 46.1\n        hellaswag: 61.5\n      graduated_minus_binary_pp: 0.6\n      paired_t_p: 0.08\n    dose_50pct:\n      no_filter:\n        mmlu: 43.5\n        hellaswag: 58.8\n      binary_ours:\n        mmlu: 44.8\n        hellaswag: 60.1\n      graduated:\n        mmlu: 45.9\n        hellaswag: 61.0\n      graduated_minus_binary_pp: 1.1\n      paired_t_p: 0.038\n    dose_response_trend: monotonically increasing graduated−binary delta with contamination\n      dose\n  result_rationale: 'graduated vs binary 收益随 dose 单调递增 (0.2→0.6→1.1pp)。 10% 时差异可忽略\n    (p=0.32)：contaminated 样本占比小，binary 已能移除大部分， graduated 的边际价值被 clean data 主导的 signal\n    淹没。 30% 时 borderline (p=0.08)：binary 误杀 gen-1（质量可接受）的代价开始显现， graduated 保留部分 gen-1\n    内容。 50% 时 significant (p=0.038)：高比例 contamination 下 gen-1 样本数量庞大， binary 丢弃它们的损失显著，graduated\n    的 calibrated weighting 优势放大。 实际 web data synthetic 比例目前估计 10-30%， 所以 graduated\n    filtering 的真实收益大概率在 0.2-0.6pp 的 borderline 范围。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Dose-response matrix — MMLU/HellaSwag × {10%, 30%, 50%} × {no-filter,\n    binary, graduated}'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: contamination dose (x) vs graduated−binary delta (y), 显示近线性增长'\n  - 'Stacked area chart: dose × 策略, 显示 graduated 在高 dose 下优势扩大'\n  analysis: 'dose-response 为 C3 提供 nuanced framing: \"practical value scales with contamination\n    prevalence: at moderate levels (30%) benefit is borderline (0.6pp, p=0.08); at\n    high contamination (50%) it becomes significant (1.1pp, p<0.04).\" 比 flat \"graduated\n    is better\" 更 honest 也更有学术价值。 50% 是 worst-case，但 web contamination trend 持续上升——graduated\n    filtering 的价值可能随时间增长。\n\n    '\n- name: LLM zero-shot depth estimation baseline\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: GPT-4o / Claude 3.5 对 depth 0-4 文本做 zero-shot depth 判断。API cost only,\n    no GPU。\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o:\n      binary_accuracy_0v1: 0.72\n      accuracy_3class: 0.38\n      accuracy_6class: 0.2\n      depth_spearman_rho: 0.18\n      mae: 1.85\n    claude_3_5:\n      binary_accuracy_0v1: 0.68\n      accuracy_3class: 0.36\n      accuracy_6class: 0.19\n      depth_spearman_rho: 0.15\n      mae: 1.92\n    random_baselines:\n      accuracy_6class_chance: 0.167\n      accuracy_3class_chance: 0.333\n    our_method_reference:\n      accuracy_6class: 0.42\n      accuracy_3class: 0.63\n      depth_spearman_rho: 0.55\n  result_rationale: 'LLM 在 binary detection (0v1) 有一定能力 (~70%)：人类与合成文本在流畅度、重复性、 generic\n    phrasing 等维度有 perceptible 差异。但 depth estimation 接近 chance: 代际间差异是 subtle statistical\n    patterns (surprisal 分布高阶矩、频率分布尾部行为)， 非 LLM prompt 可捕捉的显式质量指标。 3-class accuracy\n    ~37% ≈ chance (33.3%)，说明即使简化为 3 级任务 LLM 仍无能为力。 Spearman ρ ≈ 0.15-0.18 仅有极弱单调关系。GPT-4o\n    略优于 Claude (72% vs 68% on 0v1) 可能因训练数据中包含更多 synthetic text artifact 讨论，但差异不显著且与\n    depth 无关。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: LLM zero-shot vs our 15D method — accuracy (6/3-class), MAE, Spearman\n    ρ'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Confusion matrix heatmaps: GPT-4o / Claude 3.5 zero-shot predictions vs true\n    depth — 仅 gen-0 row 有对角集中，其余近均匀'\n  analysis: '强化 C1'' novelty: \"State-of-the-art LLMs achieve near-chance on depth\n    estimation (3-class accuracy 36-38% vs chance 33%), confirming generational depth\n    is a distributional property requiring specialized measurement, not a surface\n    quality attribute.\" 这个 baseline 直接回应 \"为什么需要专门方法\" 的潜在质疑。\n\n    '\n- name: Binary detector confidence as depth proxy\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: DivEye / Binoculars confidence score 与 true depth 的 Spearman correlation，验证\n    binary confidence ≠ depth。\n  expected_results:\n    diveye:\n      binary_auc_0v1: 0.882\n      spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth: 0.215\n      auc_1v2_from_confidence: 0.548\n      auc_2v3_from_confidence: 0.512\n    binoculars:\n      binary_auc_0v1: 0.907\n      spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth: 0.192\n      auc_1v2_from_confidence: 0.534\n      auc_2v3_from_confidence: 0.508\n    our_method_reference:\n      spearman_rho_vs_depth: 0.553\n      auc_1v2: 0.654\n      auc_2v3: 0.552\n  result_rationale: 'Binary detectors 的 confidence 与 depth 有弱正相关 (ρ≈0.19-0.22)： 更深代际文本更\"像合成\"，confidence\n    缓慢上升。但远弱于我们的方法 (ρ=0.55)， 因为 binary confidence 主要捕捉 0v1 的大跳变，对 1v2+ 微小差异不敏感—— 这些\n    detectors 的 decision boundary 在 real/synthetic 边界，不在 gen-1/gen-2 边界。 Binoculars\n    binary AUC (0.907) > DivEye (0.882) 但 depth ρ 反而更低 (0.192 vs 0.215)—— 更好的 binary\n    detector 不自动成为更好的 depth estimator，证明二者是不同任务。 1v2 AUC from confidence (0.534-0.548)\n    远低于我们的 15D features (0.654)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Binary detector confidence as depth proxy — Spearman ρ, per-pair AUC,\n    vs 15D method'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: Binoculars confidence vs true depth — gen-0/gen-1 分离明显，gen-1+ 基本平坦'\n  - 'AUC decay comparison: 15D method vs DivEye/Binoculars confidence 的 per-pair AUC'\n  analysis: '直接回答审稿人 \"为什么不直接用 binary confidence 做 graduated filtering\"。 论文写法: \"Binary\n    detection confidence provides a poor depth proxy (ρ ≤ 0.22 vs 0.55), confirming\n    that depth estimation requires features capturing distributional shifts beyond\n    the real/synthetic boundary.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: CC 2025/2026 snapshot 样本 (10K docs) 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary\n    richness、self-BLEU、perplexity 做 correlation。\n  expected_results:\n    depth_distribution_cc2025:\n      predicted_gen0_pct: 83.2\n      predicted_gen1_pct: 11.5\n      predicted_gen2plus_pct: 5.3\n    correlation_with_proxies:\n      spearman_rho_align_score: -0.28\n      spearman_rho_vocab_richness_ttr: -0.24\n      spearman_rho_self_bleu: 0.19\n      spearman_rho_perplexity_gpt2: -0.31\n    confidence_calibration:\n      mean_confidence_gen0: 0.78\n      mean_confidence_gen1: 0.52\n      mean_confidence_gen2plus: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'CC 上 depth 预测分布 (83/12/5) 与当前 web synthetic content 比例估计 (10-20%)\n    粗略一致。 AlignScore 负相关 (ρ=-0.28)：预测为更深代际的文本事实一致性更差，符合 model collapse 理论。 但相关性偏弱因为:\n    (1) 无 ground truth depth labels，只能做 proxy correlation； (2) CC \"合成文本\" 来自多种 LLM/pipeline，与单模型受控实验分布不同；\n    (3) domain/length/genre 是强混淆变量。 perplexity 相关性稍高 (ρ=-0.31) 因为 synthetic 文本在 GPT-2\n    下 perplexity 更低 （更接近 LM 的 typical set）。confidence 校准显示模型对 gen-2+ 不确定性更高 (0.41\n    vs 0.78)， 符合 K*=2 预期——gen-2+ 之间确实难以区分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Predicted depth distribution on CC 2025 (10K sample)'\n  - 'Table: Spearman ρ between predicted depth and four independent quality proxies'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Histogram: CC 2025 predicted depth distribution'\n  - 'Scatter + trend line: predicted depth vs AlignScore, 弱负相关'\n  analysis: '提供 directional evidence 但非 conclusive proof。定位为 \"preliminary ecological\n    validation\"， 承认没有 ground truth。ρ≈0.24-0.31 弱相关在 web data confounders 下是合理的。 主要回应\n    reviewer concern #3 (ecological validity)，strength 有限——作为 supplementary analysis。\n\n    '\n- name: Learned representation baseline\n  plan_id: exp-015\n  description: Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B last-hidden-state (1536d) + 2-layer MLP vs hand-crafted\n    15D features。验证 interpretable features 的价值上限。\n  expected_results:\n    learned_frozen_mlp:\n      qwen_rewrite:\n        accuracy: 0.4785\n        mae: 0.8512\n        tau_b: 0.6195\n        mean_pw_auc: 0.6823\n        auc_1v2: 0.7342\n      pythia:\n        accuracy: 0.4358\n        mae: 0.9624\n        tau_b: 0.5412\n        mean_pw_auc: 0.6498\n        auc_1v2: 0.6973\n      olmo:\n        accuracy: 0.431\n        mae: 0.9787\n        tau_b: 0.5318\n        mean_pw_auc: 0.6425\n        auc_1v2: 0.6582\n    handcrafted_15d_reference:\n      qwen_rewrite:\n        accuracy: 0.4229\n        mean_pw_auc: 0.6214\n        auc_1v2: 0.6955\n      pythia:\n        accuracy: 0.3856\n        mean_pw_auc: 0.6055\n        auc_1v2: 0.6539\n      olmo:\n        accuracy: 0.3822\n        mean_pw_auc: 0.6015\n        auc_1v2: 0.6145\n    delta_accuracy_pp:\n      qwen_rewrite: 5.56\n      pythia: 5.02\n      olmo: 4.88\n      mean: 5.15\n    delta_mean_pw_auc_pp:\n      qwen_rewrite: 6.09\n      pythia: 4.43\n      olmo: 4.1\n      mean: 4.87\n  result_rationale: 'frozen embedding + MLP 优于 15D hand-crafted ~5pp accuracy / ~4.9pp\n    mean_pw_auc。 原因: (1) 1536d frozen embeddings 包含 surprisal/diversity/frequency\n    等 hand-crafted  features 捕捉的信息以及高阶交互和 contextual patterns；(2) MLP 学习非线性组合， 而 LightGBM\n    虽也非线性但受限于 15d 输入；(3) LM 内部表征隐式编码 generation process artifacts。 但差距是 ~5pp 而非 overwhelming：hand-crafted\n    features 已捕捉大部分 discriminative signal （~85% of available performance），剩余 ~5pp\n    来自 high-dimensional interaction effects。 这说明 depth signal 主要是 low-dimensional\n    统计模式，learned features 的优势在于 residual pattern 捕捉，而非发现全新 signal source。 跨模型一致的 ~5pp\n    gap 说明这个差距是 structural 的，不是 dataset-specific。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Hand-crafted 15D vs Frozen-LM+MLP — accuracy, MAE, τ_b, mean_pw_auc, AUC₁ᵥ₂\n    across 3 configs'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: accuracy 15D vs learned, per config, 显示一致 ~5pp gap'\n  - 't-SNE: learned embeddings colored by depth — gen-0/gen-1 boundary 清晰, gen-2+\n    混合'\n  analysis: 'median tier 最 uncomfortable 的结果。论文必须诚实报告，但论述: (1) \"15D features capture\n    ~85% of available signal — the gap confirms our features  target the right distributional\n    properties.\" (2) \"Hand-crafted features remain uniquely valuable for degradation\n    ordering analysis (§4.3)  and cross-model transfer analysis (§4.2), which require\n    per-feature interpretability.\" (3) \"This interpretability-performance tradeoff\n    is central: learned features are stronger  but opaque; hand-crafted features support\n    the characterization that is the paper''s  primary contribution.\" 审稿人必问 \"why not\n    learned features\" — 回答是贡献在 characterization 不是 SOTA classifier。\n\n    '\n- name: Base vs Instruct model comparison\n  plan_id: exp-016\n  description: Qwen2.5-1.5B base (无 instruction tuning) vs Instruct 的 K* 和特征分布差异，continuation\n    mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5。\n  expected_results:\n    base_model:\n      k_star: 1\n      k_star_note: 'at θ=0.60: CI lower=0.5878 < 0.60 → K*=1; at θ=0.585: K*=2 — threshold-sensitive'\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9923\n        1v2: 0.5985\n        2v3: 0.5482\n        3v4: 0.5265\n        4v5: 0.5098\n      pairwise_auc_ci:\n        1v2_ci_lower: 0.5878\n        1v2_ci_upper: 0.6092\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.2415\n        1v2: 0.0042\n        2v3: 0.0031\n        3v4: 0.0028\n        4v5: 0.0024\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.362\n      ordinal_mae: 1.225\n      top3_features:\n      - surp_d1_std\n      - surp_std\n      - surp_d2_std\n    instruct_reference:\n      k_star: 2\n      auc_1v2: 0.6112\n      auc_1v2_ci_lower: 0.6015\n    instruct_minus_base:\n      auc_1v2_delta_pp: 1.27\n      auc_0v1_delta_pp: 0.49\n    feature_ranking_comparison:\n      spearman_rho_base_vs_instruct: 0.87\n      shared_top3: true\n      key_divergence: 'freq_entropy: instruct top-1 → base rank-5'\n  result_rationale: 'Base model 1v2 AUC (0.5985) 比 Instruct (0.6112) 低 ~1.3pp，CI lower\n    (0.5878)  在 θ=0.60 下方 → K*=1。 原因: instruction tuning 使模型输出更结构化、更遵循特定 pattern，\n    这些 pattern 在递归生成中的退化更 systematic 因而更 detectable。 Base model 的 continuation 输出更\n    diverse/stochastic，代际间 distributional shift  更 diffuse 更难检测。 但差异很小 (1.3pp)：depth\n    signal 主要来自 iterated generation 的信息损失， 不是 instruction-following artifact。 特征排序高度一致\n    (ρ=0.87)：surprisal 特征在两种模型中都最 discriminative。 关键差异在 freq_entropy：instruct model\n    中 rank 1 但 base 中 rank 5， 因为 instruction tuning 使词频更集中（模板化用词），这个 entropy signal\n    在递归中退化更明显。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Table: Base vs Instruct pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI'\n  - 'Table: Feature importance ranking comparison (Spearman ρ = 0.87), highlighting\n    freq_entropy divergence'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curve: base vs instruct 并列, 平行衰减但 instruct ~1pp higher'\n  - 'Feature importance bar chart: base vs instruct side-by-side, freq_entropy 箭头标注'\n  analysis: 'base model borderline K* 增加 important qualification。论文写法: \"K*=2 holds\n    for instruction-tuned models; base models show marginally weaker signal  (AUC₁ᵥ₂\n    = 0.60 vs 0.61), with the 0.60 threshold falling within the bootstrap CI. Feature\n    degradation orderings are highly consistent across variants (ρ = 0.87),  indicating\n    shared underlying mechanisms.\" 这个结果实际上 strengthen \"systematic characterization\"\n    叙事： 展示 K* 对 model variant 的 sensitivity，证明 fine-grained measurement 的必要性。 作为 §4.1\n    的子分析呈现。'\n","numLines":556,"startLine":1,"totalLines":556}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011SjGPwANc7Pdx8AXHhKXs7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the paper and the review context. Let me now dispatch two reviewers in parallel for the full review process.\n\nThe paper is about measuring the \"generational discrimination boundary\" K* in recursively contaminated text. Key claims:\n- C1: K*=2 under standard nucleus sampling at 1.5B scale\n- C2: Cross-model transfer and degradation ordering (91% accuracy retention)\n- C3: Graduated filtering provides modest improvement over binary filtering\n\nThe review context shows the imagined experiments and their expected results. Let me check coverage against the paper.\n\n\nNow I'm mapping the imagined experiments to their corresponding tables and sections in the paper—cross-scale probing, filtering evaluations, contamination dose-response, and various downstream applications all appear to have empirical support across Tables 2 through 9.\n\nI'm about to set up two parallel reviewers to evaluate the methods and experiments on one track, and novelty plus related work on the other.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30266,"cache_read_input_tokens":22939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30266},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1e26fb29-8484-47f9-8c7e-3ea9127b1a2d","uuid":"d1aeb3e7-dd9f-4160-9823-e58a5dd9e22d"}
